  "source": "# 00000006034\n\n**English.** Definition: Reduction with its quantified structure, the dimension formula. Conjecture: The conversion constant is the explicit difference of group dimension with coadjoint orbit, locally a trivial bundle for free actions; the dimension difference equals the dimension of the isotropy algebra; and the stratification of the nonfree case is indexed by isotropy types, the type count being the coadjoint-orbit count. (group-dimension coadjoint-difference conversion constant)\n\n**中文。** 定义：约化：辛商的量化结构（维数公式）。猜想：换算常数为群维数与余伴随轨道的显式差且自由作用时为局部平凡丛；维数差等于迷向代数的维数；非自由情形的分层由迷向型索引且型的个数为余伴随轨道数。（群维数余伴随差换算常数）\n",
